  @1.1.1 -22dB @5.1.1 -27dB smooth @13.1.1 -17dB smooth @21.1.1 -13dB smooth @25.1.1 -11dB smooth @37.1.1 -19dB smooth @49.1.1 -17dB smooth @53.1.1 -14dB smooth @61.1.1 -10dB smooth @65.1.1 -9dB smooth @69.1.1 -12dB smooth @73.1.1 -16dB smooth @77.1.1 -14dB smooth @81.1.1 -60dB smooth
